{"title":"Snake Meat","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Copperhead, Small Copperhead, Large Copperhead, Coral Snake, Small Coral Snake +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"large-copperhead\" title=\"Large Copperhead - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/278a681cfd44055be411.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Large Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rustscale\" title=\"Rustscale - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5b949298e5c9a12fd3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rustscale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"copperhead-large\" title=\"Large Copperhead - dropped it in 26 of 41 looted corpses (1/1.6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/741316ca8960070d6a5b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Large Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"copperhead-small\" title=\"Small Copperhead - dropped it in 66 of 106 looted corpses (1/1.6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/be8b9bef374f5b2e593b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - dr